* setup simulation cell via crystal 
*

! Update A,B,C from dyn.xsc, Alpha,Beta,Gamma from step5_assembly.str
crystal define tetragonal 61.2866326895 61.2866326895 82.0953203235 90. 90. 90.   
open read unit 4 card name box.cry
crystal read unit 4 card
close unit 4
! IMAGE CENTERING BY RESIDUE
image byres

return

